een a paranormal investigators sourcebook and such. If that had been the case I probably would have jumped very quickly on it...</div> </div> </div> </div>This does seem more paranormal investigators than ghost hunters from what I've read so far. I think Ghost Hunters just makes for a better title.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25049-zakrulz","name":"ZakRulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25049_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T14:41:18-07:00","id":1418590,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1417029-wod-ghost-hunters-ks-now-live?p=1417096#post1417096\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We got a fantastic interview with Matthew Dawkins and Matt McElroy about the product here: <a href=\"http://booknest.eu/reviews/blog/2064-interviewwithmattmcelroyandmatthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\">http://booknest.eu/reviews/blog/2064...matthewdawkins</a><br /> <br /> Really interesting stuff!</div> </div> </div> </div>Does this mean McElroy is back or was this interview done in advance?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25049-zakrulz","name":"ZakRulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avat