:[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-17T12:52:35-07:00","id":1418690,"title":"","content":"I'm hoping at some point options come up for more high tier rewards. The create an item/monster/npc type of rewards that have been added during other Kickstarters once certain stretch goals are hit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25049-zakrulz","name":"ZakRulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25049_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-17T17:18:03-07:00","id":1418739,"title":"","content":"Chapters 3 and 4 are now out to backers.<br /> <br /> Oh, and we got the Hunting Monsters supplement covering interactions with non-ghost supernaturals, including that getting doubled. and a backer t-shirt.<br /> <br /> $50k we're getting a wallpaper, and at $52k we're getting...a supplement about mortal necromancers. Complete with new Hedge Magic paths that revolve around interacting with the dead.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-19T13:16:52-07:00","id":1419075,"title":"","content":"I've got a feeling this is gonna be the closest thing to a Sorcerer 20th that we'll be getting. Don't disappoint me Matt.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1VN49Y7tH2ZV0l7Hx65RWX1ez-Q9Lst-8ZTyTJeCTpxM/\" target=\"_blank\">Sorcerer 20th</a> homebrew and my update to <a href=\"http://immortalthegathering.blogspot.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Highlander: the Gathering</a> for 20th Anniversary edition.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2414-theoutlander523","name":"theoutlander523","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2414_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-19T18:15:20-07:00","id":1419101,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>theoutlander523</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1417029-wod-ghost-hunters-ks-now-live?p=1419075#post1419075\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've got a feeling this is gonna be the closest thing to a Sorcerer 20th that we'll be getting. Don't disappoint me Matt.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, Hunters Hunted II already has Hedge Magic in it. It's just a question of which will have more.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25049-zakrulz","name":"ZakRulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25049_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-22T23:48:26-07:00","id":1419726,"title":"","content":"I like the update bit about planning out an investigation. That is the sort of practical information that, in hindsight, I wish more of the old hunter/investigator books had included. (like how a police or FBI case works, what happens when the Catholic Church decides to do an exorcism, etc.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-31T12:44:55-07:00","id":1421193,"title":"","content":"The Kickstarter has ended with 13 stretch goals being reached. So in addition to the book, we're going to get.<ul><li><span style=\"color:#282828\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><i><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Paranormal</span></span></i></span></span><span style=\"color:#282828\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><i><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Investigator's Toolkit</span></span></i></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#282828\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><i><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Hunting Monsters</span></i></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#282828\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><i><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Necromancers &amp; Mediums</span></span></i></span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#282828\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><i><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Ghost Hunters</span></span></i></span></span><span style=\"color:#282828\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><i><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Jumpstart</span></span></i></span></span></li> </ul>I'm looking forward to seeing how they come out. The Necromancers &amp; Mediums supplement is probably the one I'm most interested in seeing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25049-zakrulz","name":"ZakRulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25049_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-01T13:17:37-08:00","id":1421331,"title":"","content":"Gosh darn it! I completely missed this! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> This looks so cool!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15685-up-to-eleven","name":"Up-to-Eleven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar15685_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"61"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}